# Sony PDX245 Telephony SELinux Policy (system_ext)
#
# DISABLED: QPR2 regression revert (Feb 16, 2026)
#
# This policy added platform_app to hal_telephony_client attribute and
# allowed access to hal_telephony_hwservice. It was needed for
# qcrilmsgtunnel and ims.apk to communicate with vendor telephony HALs.
#
# However, this (along with the telephony framework JARs) enabled vendor
# IMS daemons to partially initialize, causing the modem to route incoming
# SMS through IMS. Since IMS never fully registers on the GSI, SMS was
# silently dropped at the modem level.
#
# On QPR1 (no telephony SELinux policy), CS SMS worked perfectly.
#
# typeattribute platform_app hal_telephony_client;
# allow platform_app hal_telephony_hwservice:hwservice_manager { find };
